&lt;p&gt;The Senior Director, Learning eXperience Curator is a regionally embedded people leader responsible for translating The Learning Collective’s learning, performance, and growth strategy into practical, high‑impact execution on learning experiences across a multi‑region portfolio. This role develops and leads in-person and virtual learning experiences across international regions in Europe, Africa, Australia &amp;amp; New Zealand, and Asia &amp;amp; Middle East. In this role you will ensure learning experiences are globally aligned and locally resonant, while building scalable delivery capacity through a strong Train‑the‑Trainer program and Learning Ambassador network.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoMsg_Job&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Text&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Participate in setting the global learning strategy&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring that local and regional cultural needs and differences are represented and considered. Drive its delivery across international markets, ensuring regional consistency while addressing local learning needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Establish strategic partnerships with Regional Presidents and Regional PX VPs&lt;/strong&gt; to translate the TLC Strategy into regional and local deliverables and learning experiences. Define regional learning agendas aligned with the global strategy and, where required, reflecting varying levels of learning maturity, in line with TLC standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead needs analyses with PX Business Partners and leaders; &lt;/strong&gt;convert insight into scalable, measurable learning solutions that improve performance, skills, and capability development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design and facilitate high‑impact learning or group coaching experiences&lt;/strong&gt; (live and virtual) that drive behavior change, team effectiveness, and high performance across multiple cultures and seniority levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Train‑the‑Trainer (TTT) for International: &lt;/strong&gt;design and deliver TTT recruitment and enablement, develop facilitator standards, build practice and quality loops (observation, feedback, co‑facilitation), and sustain a facilitator community rhythm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead through a matrix: &lt;/strong&gt;directly manage relevant local learning roles and provide support and coaching to the extended TLC team, Learning Ambassadors, and cross‑regional contributors to ensure consistent quality and adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ensure governance and coherence: &lt;/strong&gt;reduce duplication, maintain quality, and partner with internal content/design/communications and external partners where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embed measurement: &lt;/strong&gt;define success metrics and reporting, share executive‑ready insights, and continuously improve experiences based on data and feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven senior learning leader with significant experience designing and facilitating learning experiences (live and virtual) that deliver measurable behaviour change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong people leader with experience coaching and developing teams across geographies, cultures, and time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident working in matrixed organizations with dual reporting lines and high stakeholder complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culturally fluent and agile - able to tailor content and approach across regions, audiences, role functions, and business contexts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coaching capability strongly preferred; ICF accreditation (or progress toward) is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, adaptable and experienced in creative environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to influence and partner with senior leaders and cross‑functional stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in adult learning principles, leadership frameworks, and learning measurement methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;There will be travel required in this role.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with digital learning platforms, learning analytics, and modern learning technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoMsg_Job&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we give you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Arial&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You join a vibrant global community with the opportunity to channel your passion every day&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Arial&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A modern office environment designed for you, empowering you to bring your best&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Arial&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Investment in your professional growth and development enabling you to thrive in our vibrant community&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Arial&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The space to accelerate progress, positively disrupt and create what happens next&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Arial&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;5&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We give you the platform to champion positive change, with the opportunity to contribute to our social impact, diversity, equity and inclusion initiatives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Arial&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;6&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We provide an excellent range of benefits like private medical cover, a generous pension scheme, life assurance, income protection, plus loads of music industry perks. There’s also time off over winter break&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Music is committed to equal opportunities and to providing a respectful, inclusive environment. We welcome applications from all backgrounds and do not discriminate on the basis of protected characteristics. Reasonable adjustments are available throughout the recruitment process, please let us know what support you need.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an active part of a culturally and socially diverse society, Sony Music’s aim is that our workforce is diverse and inclusive. Sony Music is an equal opportunity employer and supports workforce diversity.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We employ, retain, promote and otherwise treat all employees and job applicants according to their merit, qualifications, competence and talent. We apply this policy without regard to any individual’s sex, race, religion, origin, age, sexual orientation, marital status, medical condition or disability.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please click&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://tools.sonymusiccreative.com/privacy/PCP_UK.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to read our privacy policy before beginning the application process as you will need to agree to the terms of the policy before submitting your information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note that applicants must be at least 18 years of age.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Remote&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Remote is solving modern organizations’ biggest challenge – navigating global employment compliantly with ease. We make it possible for businesses of all sizes to recruit, pay, and manage international teams. With our core values at heart and future focused work culture, our team works tirelessly on ambitious problems, asynchronously, around the world. You can find Remoters working from 6 different continents (Antarctica left to go!) and all of our positions are fully remote.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;discussion-id-2f7cb4da-dab4-8068-a80f-001c50b2d808 suggestion-update notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;With Innovation as one of the core values, we have built Automation and AI capabilities into the requirements for every role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We encourage every member of the Remote team to bring their talents, experiences and culture to the table to help us build the best-in-class HR platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you are energetic, curious, motivated and ambitious, be part of our world. Apply now and define the future of work!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Strategic Alliances Principal, UK&amp;amp;I&lt;/strong&gt;, you will execute the field-level alliance motion with select strategic Remote Embedded Partners in a defined set of regions/segments/accounts across UK&amp;amp;I. You will be on the ground (virtually and in-person) with Partners’ sellers, sales leaders, and solution consultants — building trust, creating demand, and converting ecosystem engagement into sourced and influenced pipeline for &lt;strong&gt;Global Payroll&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Employer of Record (EOR)&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Contractor Management / Contractor of Record (CM/COR)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You work in close partnership with Embedded Sales, Partner Marketing, Sales Enablement, Solutions Consulting, and cross-functional stakeholders to ensure Remote is consistently brought into the right opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What success looks like&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong relationships and high engagement with your Partners’ field stakeholders; Remote is top-of-mind in relevant cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistent, measurable growth in Partner-sourced and Partner-influenced pipeline within your coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Repeatable execution of alliance plays (enablement moments, events, account mapping, follow-ups).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-quality deal intake: the right opportunities, with the right stakeholders, at the right time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tight collaboration with Remote GTM teams to progress deals quickly and professionally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Relationship building &amp;amp; field activation&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain ground-level relationships with Partners’ field stakeholders (account executives, account managers, sales leadership, solution consultants, specialists).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run account mapping and coverage planning with Partners’ GTM teams to identify priority accounts and active initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed into Partners’ cadences (pipeline reviews, regional meetings, enablement sessions) to drive consistent activation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Pipeline sourcing &amp;amp; co-sell support&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively source opportunities for Global Payroll, EOR, and CM/COR from Partners field teams and related SIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support co-sell execution: qualification, stakeholder mapping, mutual action plans, and coordination of the right Remote resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate reporting on relationship coverage, sourced/influenced pipeline, conversion, and next steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Awareness, enablement, and events&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive awareness of Remote’s value proposition through targeted enablement moments, content distribution, and local advocacy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Partner Marketing to organize, sponsor, and attend field and ecosystem events (including ecosystem events and SI-led moments).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own event execution for your territory: targeting, meeting scheduling, on-site engagement, and post-event conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Operating rhythm &amp;amp; continuous improvement&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow a disciplined weekly operating rhythm (field touchpoints, pipeline reviews, internal syncs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capture partner feedback and competitive insights; share clear signals back to the wider Remote / Partner teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help build and refine alliance playbooks and reusable assets as the motion scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience Strategic Alliance partners and their ecosystem (field org dynamics, partner motions, and how decisions get made).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong relationship-building skills and comfort operating with senior field stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of sourcing and progressing pipeline in multi-stakeholder enterprise contexts (alliances, partnerships, sales, or partner GTM roles)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized operator: you run a tight cadence, follow through, and keep data/reporting clean.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel 50–70%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demonstrates strong automation and AI capabilities and AI fluency.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Practicals&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Partnerships / Embedded&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; UK or Ireland (remote)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel:&lt;/strong&gt; 50–70%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start date:&lt;/strong&gt; As soon as possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Remote Compensation Philosophy&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Remote&#39;s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/people-Total-Rewards-1945bce8d3924ece9421ba8630f57b0c?pvs=21&quot;&gt;Total Rewards philosophy&lt;/a&gt; is to ensure fair, unbiased compensation and fair equity pay along with competitive benefits in all locations in which we operate. We do not agree to or encourage cheap-labor practices and therefore we ensure to pay above in-location rates. We hope to inspire other companies to support global talent-hiring and bring local wealth to developing countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At first glance our salary bands seem quite wide - here is some context. At Remote we have international operations and a globally distributed workforce. We use geo ranges to consider geographic pay differentials as part of our global compensation strategy to remain competitive in various markets while we hiring globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The On-Target Earnings for this position is between $150,000 - $225,000 USD. The base salary is 60%. Our salary ranges are determined by role, level and location, and our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay for the successful candidate in this role is dependent upon many factors such as location, transferable or job-related skills, work experience, relevant training, business needs, and market demands. The base salary range may be subject to change.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Application process&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview with recruiter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview with future manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview with team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bar Raiser Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/Veremark-Remote-96e108c037b8423cbd4c3f07a1f9b38b&quot;&gt;Prior employment verification check&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Remote&#39;s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/remotecom/people-Total-Rewards-1945bce8d3924ece9421ba8630f57b0c&quot;&gt;Total Rewards philosophy&lt;/a&gt; is to ensure fair, unbiased compensation and fair &lt;span class=&quot;link-annotation-unknown-block-id-1691622878&quot;&gt;equity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;discussion-level-1 discussion-id-f2a82bc4-09e4-4a71-ad93-755b1d26a690 notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;3&quot;&gt; pay &lt;/span&gt;along with competitive benefits in all locations in which we operate. We do not agree to or encourage cheap-labor practices and therefore we ensure to pay above in-location rates. We hope to inspire other companies to support global talent-hiring and bring local wealth to developing countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At first glance our salary bands seem quite wide - here is some context. At Remote we have international operations and a globally distributed workforce.&amp;nbsp; We use geo ranges to consider geographic pay differentials as part of our global compensation strategy to remain competitive in various markets while we hiring globally.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our salary ranges are determined by role, level and location, and our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay for the successful candidate in this role is dependent upon many factors such as location, transferable or job-related skills, work experience, relevant training, business needs, and market demands. The base salary range may be subject to change.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;At Remote, we foster internal mobility as a key element of our culture of employee growth and development, supported by a compensation philosophy that guarantees pay equity and fairness. Therefore, all compensation changes associated with an internal move will be reviewed by the Total Rewards &amp;amp; People Enablement team on a case by case basis.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual salary range for this full-time position is&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$150,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$225,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our full benefits &amp;amp; perks are explained in our handbook at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;http://remote.com/r/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://remote.com/r/benefits&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;remote.com/r/benefits&lt;/a&gt;. As a global company, each country works differently, but some benefits/perks are for all Remoters:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;work from anywhere&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;flexible paid time off&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;flexible working hours (we are&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://remote.com/async&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.notion.so/remotecom/Working-Async-at-Remote-80c01cd443ad4c77a8ceaef7c5fba5d0&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;async&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;16 weeks paid parental leave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;mental health support services&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;stock options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;learning budget&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;home office budget &amp;amp; IT equipment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;budget for local in-person social events or co-working spaces&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you’ll plan your day (and life)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We work async at Remote which means you can plan your schedule around your life (and not around meetings). Read more at &lt;a href=&quot;https://remote.com/async&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;remote.com/async&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will be empowered to take ownership and be proactive. When in doubt you will default to action instead of waiting. Your &lt;strong&gt;life-work balance&lt;/strong&gt; is important and you will be encouraged to put yourself and your family first, and fit work around your needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If that sounds like something you want, apply now!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to apply&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Please fill out the form below and upload your CV with a PDF format.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;We kindly ask you to submit your application and CV in English, as this is the standardised language we use here at Remote.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you don’t have an up to date CV but you are still interested in talking to us, please feel free to add a copy of your LinkedIn profile instead.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We will ask you to voluntarily tell us your pronouns at interview stage, and you will have the option to answer our anonymous demographic questionnaire when you apply below. As an equal employment opportunity employer it’s important to us that our workforce reflects people of all backgrounds, identities, and experiences and this data will help us to stay accountable. We thank you for providing this data, if you chose to.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;card__StyledCardWrapper-dBKTwi cFeAoi&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;card__CardBody-bvVejm sc-bhEQgl fFUAuO kNqnAr&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sc-enMWgk bdPkLW sc-dZynEB bzAXKI&quot; data-provides=&quot;description_conclusion&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sc-eOlSkh itA-dtx&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note we accept applications on an ongoing basis.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is a new company operating at the intersection of collectibles, culture, and technology. Backed by world-class investors, operators, and sports &amp;amp; entertainment partners, we are building the global leader in next-generation collectibles. As part of the broader Fanatics ecosystem, we leverage a digital sports platform that spans over 900 sports properties and engages more than 81 million fans. Together, we are reimagining every part of the collectibles experience for fans, partners, and creators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Live &amp;amp; Collect is building the future of live commerce for sports fans and collectors, bringing together content, community, and commerce in highly interactive digital experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Staff Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to shape the technical strategy and architecture behind Fanatics Live’s streaming experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;This role requires strong end-to-end engineering knowledge, with particular depth in frontend development. You’ll define how we build high-performance customer experiences using &lt;strong&gt;React and GraphQL&lt;/strong&gt;, while influencing the backend services, APIs and event-driven systems that power them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;As one of the senior technical leaders within a new and growing team, your focus will extend beyond coding. You’ll set architectural direction, solve complex cross-team challenges and establish the engineering standards, practices and culture needed to scale successfully.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You’ll remain technically close to delivery—using prototypes, design reviews and targeted implementation to validate decisions and unblock teams—while creating leverage across the wider engineering organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the technical strategy for our consumer streaming product and supporting services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the end-to-end architecture across frontend applications, APIs, backend services and event-driven systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide the development of scalable experiences combining live video, real-time interaction, discovery and commerce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead major technical decisions across performance, reliability, resilience and platform scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create a clear technical roadmap that balances immediate product delivery with long-term platform health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define how engineering teams design, build, review, test and operate software as the organisation scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish reusable patterns and technical standards that improve quality and accelerate delivery across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineering leaders, Product, Design and Data to turn ambitious product ideas into scalable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remain close to delivery through architecture reviews, prototyping, code reviews and targeted contributions to critical areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers, build alignment across teams and raise the overall technical bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the technical response to significant production challenges and turn learnings into lasting platform improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of software engineering experience, including significant experience operating at Staff or equivalent level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong full-stack engineering knowledge, with deep expertise in modern frontend development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience with &lt;strong&gt;React&lt;/strong&gt;, JavaScript/TypeScript and complex consumer web applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with &lt;strong&gt;GraphQL&lt;/strong&gt;, APIs, backend services and frontend-to-backend integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience setting technical direction for &lt;strong&gt;streaming products or streaming services&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of distributed systems, event-driven architecture and end-to-end system design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing high-scale, real-time products with demanding performance and reliability requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead complex technical initiatives across multiple teams and systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience shaping engineering standards, technical practices and team culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong architectural judgment and the ability to influence without relying on formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of mentoring engineers and making teams more effective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product judgment and the ability to balance delivery speed, customer experience and long-term technical health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience across live commerce, marketplaces, auctions, social/community products or e-commerce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting high-profile live events and rapidly changing traffic patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of real-time communication technologies, payments or transactional systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Live brings together creators, fans, interactive live experiences, commerce, and community, making experience with real-time and high-scale consumer platforms particularly relevant to the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The above list of job duties is not exclusive or exhaustive and the post holder will be required to undertake such tasks as may reasonably be expected within the scope and grading of the post.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Subject to applicable laws, Fanatics Collectibles may choose to run a background check.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ensure your Fanatics job offer is legitimate and don’t fall victim to fraud.&amp;nbsp; Fanatics never seeks payment from job applicants.&amp;nbsp;Feel free to ask your recruiter for a phone call or other type of communication for interview, and ensure your communication is coming from a Fanatics email address (including ----- For added security, where possible, apply through our company website at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&quot;&gt;www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is a new company operating at the intersection of collectibles, culture, and technology. Backed by world-class investors, operators, and sports &amp;amp; entertainment partners, we are building the global leader in next-generation collectibles. As part of the broader Fanatics ecosystem, we leverage a digital sports platform that spans over 900 sports properties and engages more than 81 million fans. Together, we are reimagining every part of the collectibles experience for fans, partners, and creators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is seeking a&amp;nbsp;Chief of Staff supporting the President, International and helping drive the priorities of Fanatics Collectibles across Europe, Asia-Pacific and Latin America. Acting as a strategic and operational partner to the President, this role combines business planning, financial insight, strong judgment and hands-on execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This person will help run the operating cadence for the international business, turn strategy into clear actions and keep regional and global teams aligned. The role works closely with leaders across the Company, and will lead important projects on behalf of the President.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Strategy Decision Support and President Enablement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the President to shape, challenge and communicate the strategy and priorities for the international business, with clear tradeoffs, timing and ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the President on complex decisions by framing the issues, gathering input and presenting clear options and recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead preparation for executive reviews, leadership meetings, offsites and major partner discussions, ensuring materials are clear, supported by data and focused on decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn the President&#39;s direction into clear objectives, actions and measures of success for the international leadership team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;2. International Alignment and Cross Functional Leadership&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across regional leaders and global functions to align priorities, timing and dependencies across Europe, Asia-Pacific and Latin America.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create clarity on decisions, ownership and escalation paths, and follow through to ensure agreed actions are completed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead selected cross-functional initiatives sponsored by the President, particularly where work spans markets, regions or global teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify risks, gaps or misalignment early and work with the relevant leaders to resolve them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;3. Executive Communication&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop clear presentations, updates and business narratives that connect international strategy, performance and priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare communications and briefing materials for the President for internal and external audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep leadership discussions focused on the most important business issues, decisions and actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;4. Strategic Initiatives and Special Projects&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a focused set of high-impact projects for the President, which may include growth plans, market expansion, operating model changes and new business opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set clear goals, plans, owners and checkpoints, working closely with regional and functional teams through delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review outcomes and lessons learned to improve future planning and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;5. Leadership Team Effectiveness&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the President and People team on leadership effectiveness, organizational priorities and ways of working across the international business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help the international leadership team work effectively across markets, time zones and global functions, with clear communication and accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support leaders with planning, executive communication and cross-functional collaboration when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Qualifications &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-8 years of experience in strategy, investment banking, or a Chief of Staff role within a complex international organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working closely with senior executives and leading work across multiple regions and functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial and financial understanding, including experience with business planning, budgeting, forecasting and performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong judgment and the ability to work through ambiguity, influence senior stakeholders and move work forward without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with experience producing high-quality executive materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in consumer products, sports, entertainment, media, collectibles, marketplaces or technology is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work from the London office five days per week and travel internationally from time to time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent experience required. An MBA or other advanced degree is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The above list of job duties is not exclusive or exhaustive and the post holder will be required to undertake such tasks as may reasonably be expected within the scope and grading of the post.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Subject to applicable laws, Fanatics Collectibles may choose to run a background check.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ensure your Fanatics job offer is legitimate and don’t fall victim to fraud.&amp;nbsp; Fanatics never seeks payment from job applicants.&amp;nbsp;Feel free to ask your recruiter for a phone call or other type of communication for interview, and ensure your communication is coming from a Fanatics email address (including ----- For added security, where possible, apply through our company website at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&quot;&gt;www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Figma is growing our team of passionate creatives and builders on a mission to make design accessible to all. Figma’s platform helps teams bring ideas to life—whether you&#39;re brainstorming, creating a prototype, translating designs into code, or iterating with AI. From idea to product, Figma empowers teams to streamline workflows, move faster, and work together in real time from anywhere in the world. If you&#39;re excited to shape the future of design and collaboration, join us!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Figma we believe design doesn’t end in a file or with your designer - it includes everything that goes into the product you ship: the production code that ties it all together, the systems and developer tools that make that code reliable, the context you provide to our AI agents, and the documentation that keeps everyone on the same page.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Roundtripping Area at Figma is redefining how Designers, PMs and Engineers collaborate. We are responsible for agentic workflows enabling ideation and prototyping on production codebases as well as accelerating the journey from design to code. In 2023, we launched Dev Mode, a suite of features that give developers everything they need to navigate design files and transform designs into code. In 2025, we introduced Figma’s MCP, accelerating how ideas get to production. Looking to the future, we aim to further reduce the barriers between design to code and code to design allowing ideation, prototyping and productionalising to happen seamlessly where it most makes sense.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Roundtripping team is expanding, and we’re hiring AI Product Engineers across multiple levels in the UK. We’re looking for people who have built generative AI products and are eager to lead AI efforts end-to-end, from early ideas to production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us in shaping the future of AI at Figma.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you’ll do at Figma:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and evolve Dev Mode our MCP tools and Make, Figma’s leading tools for dev/design collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take part in building new 0→1 products within the agentic coding space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with designers, PMs, and other engineers craft high quality products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a mentor to, and be mentored by, exceptional peers across engineering, product and design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong personal connections with your teammates and help shape Figma’s culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;We’d love to hear from you if you have:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of leading large scale engineering projects with high impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with user facing LLM and agentic product features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience curating and developing eval sets and LLMs as judges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail, quality, and craftsmanship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High velocity and a focus on user impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;While it’s not required, it’s an added plus if you also have:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving XFN projects collaborating with Product, Design, Data and Research&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shipping user-facing features or products as a full-stack developer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated strong fluency with React and Typescript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience communicating and working across functions to proactively drive solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trained or fine-tuned LLMs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Figma, one of our values is Grow as you go. We believe in hiring smart, curious people who are excited to learn and develop their skills. If you&#39;re excited about this role but your past experience doesn&#39;t align perfectly with the points outlined in the job description, we encourage you to apply anyways. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Figma we celebrate and support our differences. We know employing a team rich in diverse thoughts, experiences, and opinions allows our employees, our product and our community to flourish. Figma is an &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2022-10/EEOC_KnowYourRights_screen_reader_10_20.pdf&quot;&gt;equal opportunity workplace&lt;/a&gt; - we are dedicated to equal employment opportunities regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity/expression, veteran status&lt;strong&gt;, &lt;/strong&gt;or any other characteristic protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will work to ensure individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodation to apply for a role, participate in the interview process, perform essential job functions, and receive other benefits and privileges of employment. If you require accommodation, please reach out to &lt;a ---------- These modifications enable an individual with a disability to have an equal opportunity not only to get a job, but successfully perform their job tasks to the same extent as people without disabilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Examples of accommodations include but are not limited to:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Holding interviews in an accessible location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enabling closed captioning on video conferencing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring all written communication be compatible with screen readers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changing the mode or format of interviews&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To ensure the integrity of our hiring process and facilitate a more personal connection, we require all candidates keep their cameras on during video interviews. Additionally, if hired you will be required to attend in person onboarding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this job, the candidate acknowledges and agrees that any personal data contained in their application or supporting materials will be processed in accordance with &lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.figma.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.figma.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Figma&#39;s Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Tripadvisor&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Tripadvisor Group connects people to experiences worth sharing, and aims to be the world’s most trusted source for travel and experiences. We leverage our brands, technology, and capabilities to connect our global audience with partners through rich content, travel guidance, and two-sided marketplaces for experiences, accommodations, restaurants, and other travel categories. The subsidiaries of Tripadvisor, Inc. (Nasdaq: TRIP), include a portfolio of travel brands and businesses, including Tripadvisor, Viator, and TheFork.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our Data Platform team is the engineering backbone of Tripadvisor’s data ecosystem. Formed from the core fundamentals of our Data Engineering and Software Engineering (Data Platform) groups, this unified team combines deep data pipeline expertise with robust platform engineering capabilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are responsible for providing the software and infrastructure that enable Tripadvisor to better understand visitor preferences and drive GenAI, Analytical, and DSML initiatives at petabyte scale. We build the frameworks, infrastructure, tooling, data modeling, and best practices that ensure consistent, well-governed, high-quality data products everywhere; and we directly own a deliberate set of business-critical, cross-cutting data products.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our work spans:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Streaming and batch data platforms that unlock data across Tripadvisor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;ETL pipelines and data models serving terabytes and growing datasets in Snowflake, BigQuery, and Hive&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Orchestration, scheduling, and ETL generation tools to support cloud migrations and petabyte-scale operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Tracking instrumentation, information architecture, and data governance tooling for business-critical analytics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Self-service and agentic analytics capabilities — governed, natural-language access to trustworthy data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Tripadvisor is looking for a Senior Data Engineer to join our fast-moving Data Platform group. In this role, you will design, build, and sustain the data infrastructure that powers the world’s most trusted travel platform. You&#39;ll pair strong software engineering fundamentals with deep data engineering expertise, set technical direction, architecting reliable pipelines, and delivering end-to-end solutions that scale to hundreds of millions of travelers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do you enjoy building features end-to-end? Do you thrive working with a broad technology stack, releasing frequently, and collaborating with talented engineers worldwide? If so, we’d love to talk.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We collaborate closely with Product, Analytics, Data Science, CRM, Marketing, Finance, and Machine Learning teams across Tripadvisor’s global engineering organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Engineering &amp;amp; Data Products &amp;amp; Enablement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Own the full lifecycle of business critical data pipelines: define SLAs, implement performance measurement, monitoring, alerting, and anomaly detection, and lead incident response and root-cause analysis.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Define scalable, reusable data models and curated data sets for analytics, data science, CRM, machine learning, and other data consumers across the organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Design, build, and maintain robust ETL/ELT data pipelines that process terabyte- to petabyte-scale data across Snowflake, BigQuery, and other platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Design, build and maintain streaming and batch systems that power real-time and analytical workloads, and lead simplification of legacy ingestion paths.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Drive warehouse standardization and technical-debt reduction as we consolidate toward one warehouse.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Drive enterprise data integrity, validation, documentation, and governance practices — and the tooling that makes them the default rather than the exception.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Apply AI to accelerate the team&#39;s own work (e.g., building reusable Claude skills for pipeline migrations and upgrades) and share those patterns with individual teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Set and evolve engineering standards, patterns, and best practices for data modeling, pipeline design, testing, and observability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
